{{also|lein|Lein|LEIN}}
==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|gmh|de}} ''-elīn'', from {{etyl|goh|de}} ''-ilī(n)''. In modern Standard German replaced by {{term|-chen|lang=de}}.<ref>{{R:EWddS|ed=22|hw=-lein}}</ref>

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/laɪ̯n/|lang=de}}

===Suffix===
'''-lein'''

# a form to create a [[diminutive]] form, eg. ''Kind'' -> ''Kind'''lein'''''.

